msgid "Localization using spreadsheets"
msgstr "使用試算表進行在地化"

msgid ""
"Spreadsheets are one of the most common formats for localizing games. In "
"Godot, spreadsheets are supported through the CSV format. This guide "
"explains how to work with CSVs."
msgstr ""
"試算表是遊戲在地化最常見的格式之一。在 Godot 中，透過 CSV 格式支援試算表。此"
"指南將說明如何使用 CSV。"

msgid ""
"The CSV files **must** be saved with UTF-8 encoding without a `byte order "
"mark <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byte_order_mark>`__."
msgstr ""
"CSV 檔案 **必須** 以沒有 `byte order mark <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Byte_order_mark>`__ 的 UTF-8 編碼儲存。"

msgid ""
"By default, Microsoft Excel will always save CSV files with ANSI encoding "
"rather than UTF-8. There is no built-in way to do this, but there are "
"workarounds as described `here <https://stackoverflow.com/questions/4221176/"
"excel-to-csv-with-utf8-encoding>`__."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，Microsoft Excel 會以 ANSI 而非 UTF-8 儲存 CSV。雖然沒有內建的方式"
"可直接以 UTF-8 儲存，但可依 `此處 <https://stackoverflow.com/questions/"
"4221176/excel-to-csv-with-utf8-encoding>`__ 的替代做法處理。"

msgid ""
"We recommend using `LibreOffice <https://www.libreoffice.org/>`__ or Google "
"Sheets instead."
msgstr ""
"建議改用 `LibreOffice <https://www.libreoffice.org/>`__ 或 Google 試算表。"

msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "格式"

msgid "CSV files must be formatted as follows:"
msgstr "CSV 檔案必須使用如下格式："

msgid "keys"
msgstr "keys"

msgid "<lang1>"
msgstr "<語言1>"

msgid "<lang2>"
msgstr "<語言2>"

msgid "<langN>"
msgstr "<語言N>"

msgid "KEY1"
msgstr "KEY1"

msgid "string"
msgstr "字串"

msgid "KEY2"
msgstr "KEY2"

msgid "KEYN"
msgstr "KEYN"

msgid ""
"The \"lang\" tags must represent a language, which must be one of "
"the :ref:`valid locales <doc_locales>` supported by the engine, or they must "
"start with an underscore (``_``), which means the related column is served "
"as comment and won't be imported. The ``KEY`` tags must be unique and "
"represent a string universally. By convention, these are usually in "
"uppercase to differentiate them from other strings. These keys will be "
"replaced at runtime by the matching translated string. Note that the case is "
"important: ``KEY1`` and ``Key1`` will be different keys. The top-left cell "
"is ignored and can be left empty or having any content. Here's an example:"
msgstr ""
"“lang”標籤必須代表一種語言，即必須是引擎支援的\\ :ref:`有效區域設定 "
"<doc_locales>`\\ ，或者必須以底線（\\ ``_``\\ ）開頭，表示這一列是注釋，不進"
"行匯入。\\ ``KEY`` 標籤必須唯一，代表一個全域字串（通常為全大寫，以區別於其他"
"字串）。這些鍵將在執行時替換為匹配的翻譯字串。請注意，大小寫很重要，\\ "
"``KEY1`` 和 ``Key1`` 是不同的鍵。左上角的單元格會被忽略，可以留空或包含任何內"
"容。範例："

msgid "en"
msgstr "en"

msgid "es"
msgstr "es"

msgid "ja"
msgstr "ja"

msgid "GREET"
msgstr "GREET"

msgid "Hello, friend!"
msgstr "Hello, friend!"

msgid "Hola, amigo!"
msgstr "Hola, amigo!"

msgid "こんにちは"
msgstr "こんにちは"

msgid "ASK"
msgstr "ASK"

msgid "How are you?"
msgstr "How are you?"

msgid "Cómo está?"
msgstr "Cómo está?"

msgid "元気ですか"
msgstr "元気ですか"

msgid "BYE"
msgstr "BYE"

msgid "Goodbye"
msgstr "Goodbye"

msgid "Adiós"
msgstr "Adiós"

msgid "さようなら"
msgstr "さようなら"

msgid "QUOTE"
msgstr "QUOTE"

msgid "\"Hello\" said the man."
msgstr "\"Hello\" said the man."

msgid "\"Hola\" dijo el hombre."
msgstr "\"Hola\" dijo el hombre."

msgid "「こんにちは」男は言いました"
msgstr "「こんにちは」男は言いました"

msgid ""
"The same example is shown below as a comma-separated plain text file, which "
"should be the result of editing the above in a spreadsheet. When editing the "
"plain text version, be sure to enclose with double quotes any message that "
"contains commas, line breaks or double quotes, so that commas are not parsed "
"as delimiters, line breaks don't create new entries and double quotes are "
"not parsed as enclosing characters. Be sure to escape any double quotes a "
"message may contain by preceding them with another double quote. "
"Alternatively, you can select another delimiter than comma in the import "
"options."
msgstr ""
"下面是同一份 CSV 轉成純文字檔的長相，這通常是你用試算表編輯好之後存檔的結果。"
"如果你直接編輯純文字 CSV，要特別注意：只要內容有逗號、換行或雙引號，整段一定"
"要加雙引號，否則會被當成多個欄或多列，雙引號本身要用兩個連寫（\"Hello\" 變成 "
"\"\"Hello\"\"）。也可以在 Godot 匯入時改用逗號以外的分隔符。"

msgid "Specifying plural forms"
msgstr "指定複數形式"

msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.6, it is possible to specify :ref:`plural forms "
"<doc_internationalizing_games_pluralization>` in CSV files."
msgstr ""
"自 Godot 4.6 起，可以在 CSV 檔案中指定\\ :ref:`複數形式 "
"<doc_internationalizing_games_pluralization>`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"This is done by adding a column named ``?plural`` anywhere in the table "
"(except on the first column, which is reserved for translation keys). By "
"convention, it's recommended to place it on the second column. Note that in "
"the example below, the key column is the one that contains English "
"localization."
msgstr ""
"這可以通過在表中任意位置（第一列除外，第一列保留用於翻譯鍵）新增名為 ``?"
"plural`` 的列來實現。按照慣例，建議將其放在第二列。請注意，在下面的範例中，鍵"
"列是包含英文字地化的列。"

msgid ""
"Automatic Control translation is not supported when using plural forms. You "
"must translate the string manually using :ref:`tr_n() "
"<class_Object_method_tr_n>`."
msgstr ""
"在使用複數形式時，不支援自動翻譯功能。您必須使用 :ref:`tr_n() "
"<class_Object_method_tr_n>` 手動翻譯該字串。"

msgid "Specifying translation contexts"
msgstr "指定翻譯情境"

msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.6, it is possible to specify :ref:`translation contexts "
"<doc_internationalizing_games_translation_contexts>` in CSV files. This can "
"be used to disambiguate identical source strings that have different "
"meanings. While this is generally not needed when using translation keys "
"``LIKE_THIS``, it's useful when using plain English text as translation keys."
msgstr ""
"自 Godot 4.6 起，可以在 CSV 檔案中指定\\ :ref:`翻譯情境 "
"<doc_internationalizing_games_translation_contexts>`\\ 。這可用於消除含義不同"
"的相同源字串之間的歧義。雖然在使用 ``LIKE_THIS`` 這樣的翻譯鍵時通常不需要這樣"
"做，但這在使用純英文文字作為翻譯鍵時非常有用。"

msgid ""
"This is done by adding a column named ``?context`` column anywhere in the "
"table (except on the first column, which is reserved for translation keys). "
"By convention, it's recommended to place it on the second column, or after "
"``?plural`` if it's also used. Note that in the example below, the key "
"column is the one that contains English localization."
msgstr ""
"這可以通過在表中任意位置（第一列除外，第一列保留用於翻譯鍵）新增名為 ``?"
"context`` 的列來實現。按照慣例，建議將其放在第二列，或者如果也使用了 ``?"
"plural`` 列，則放在其後。請注意，在下面的範例中，鍵列是包含英文字地化的列。"

msgid ""
"Automatic Control translation is not supported when using context. You must "
"translate the string manually using :ref:`tr() <class_Object_method_tr>` "
"or :ref:`tr_n() <class_Object_method_tr_n>`."
msgstr ""
"使用情境時不支援 Control 節點的自動翻譯。你必須使用 :ref:`tr() "
"<class_Object_method_tr>` 或 :ref:`tr_n() <class_Object_method_tr_n>` 手動翻"
"譯字串。"

msgid "CSV importer"
msgstr "CSV 匯入器"

msgid ""
"Godot will treat CSV files as translations by default. It will import them "
"and generate one or more compressed translation resource files next to it."
msgstr ""
"Godot 會自動把 CSV 檔當作翻譯檔來處理，然後在同一目錄下產生一個或多個翻譯資源"
"檔（壓縮格式）。"

msgid ""
"Select the ``.csv`` file and access the :ui:`Import` dock to define import "
"options. You can toggle the compression of the imported translations, and "
"select the delimiter to use when parsing the CSV file."
msgstr ""
"選擇 ``.csv`` 檔案並存取 :ui:`Import` 停靠面板，以定義匯入選項。你可以切換是"
"否壓縮匯入的翻譯，並選擇在解析 CSV 檔案時使用的分隔符。"

msgid "Be sure to click :button:`Reimport` after any change to these options."
msgstr "對這些選項進行任何更改後，請務必點擊 :button:`Reimport` 。"

msgid "Loading the CSV file as a translation"
msgstr "將 CSV 檔案載入為翻譯"

msgid ""
"Once a CSV file is imported, it is **not** automatically registered as a "
"translation source for the project. Remember to follow the steps described "
"in :ref:`doc_internationalizing_games_configuring_imported_translation` so "
"that the translation is actually used when running the project. Godot allows "
"loading and removing translations at runtime as well."
msgstr ""
"CSV 檔案匯入後，**不會** 自動註冊為專案的翻譯來源。請記得依"
"照 :ref:`doc_internationalizing_games_configuring_imported_translation` 的步"
"驟設定，確保執行專案時實際使用這些翻譯。Godot 也允許在執行階段載入和移除翻"
"譯。"
